BEGIN:VEVENT
X-SOURCE:Knobstone Hiking Trail Association
UID:event_315885908@meetup.com
SEQUENCE:1
DTSTAMP:20260822T020341Z
DTSTART;TZID=America/New_York:20260912T093000
DTEND;TZID=America/New_York:20260912T153000
SUMMARY:2nd Weekend Work Day Trail Building
DESCRIPTION:Knobstone Hiking Trail Association of Indiana Meetup\nWould yo
 u like to spend a day in some beautiful woods with a delightful group of p
 eople building a connecting section of Indiana’s premier long distance h
 iking trail? Come join us as we continue work on the Tecumseh Trail extens
 ion portion of the KHT in MMSF. We will be building the new trail includin
 g clipping green briar.\nPlease bring a lunch and water. We will have larg
 e hand tools\, but please bring any small tools you have such as clippers 
 or a pruning saw. And a backpack is handy to carry everything in. Instruct
 ions will be provided for those who need them. We finish about 3:30.\nMeet
  at the parking lot at the base of Gose Creek Road at the end of Hinson Ro
 ad in Martinsville.\nJoin us on our website at http://www.knobstonehikingt
 rail.org/\, on Facebook at [www.facebook.com/groups/2255586117953484](http
 ://www.facebook.com/groups/2255586117953484)\, and Substack [https://khta.
 substack.com/](https://khta.substack.com/)
URL;VALUE=URI:https://www.meetup.com/knobstone-hiking-trail-association-of
 -indiana-meetup/events/315885908/
STATUS:CONFIRMED
CREATED:20260729T064000Z
LAST-MODIFIED:20260729T064000Z
CLASS:PUBLIC
END:VEVENT
